= William H. Seward

William H. Seward of New York is one of America's most accomplished diplomats and statesmen. As Secretary of State, he skillfully preserved American interests throughout the Civil War and now seeks to expand the nation's influence abroad. A leading <span style="color: #B5651D;">**Conservative**</span> within the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> Party, Seward believes the country's future lies in commerce, diplomacy, and peaceful expansion rather than ideological confrontation.

