Seward negotiates favorable commercial agreements with foreign nations, opening new markets for American manufacturers and merchants. The growing prosperity strengthens support for the administration among the nation's business community.

@seward_expansion
title: Promote American Expansion
subtitle: Advance Seward's vision of an expanding American republic.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
