Seward champions an ambitious vision of American expansion, encouraging overseas commerce, strategic acquisitions, and a stronger international presence. While many <span style="color: #9D2933;">**Moderates**</span> admire his forward-looking diplomacy, members of the <span style="color: #DAA520;">**Liberal Republicans**</span> question whether the administration's attention is drifting too far from Reconstruction.